            <ArticleTitle>Utility of electron beam computed tomography to stratify patients presenting to the emergency room with chest pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>327-8, A8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>One hundred thirty-four patients presenting to the emergency room with the chief complaint of chest pain were studied with electron beam computed tomography scan. Electron beam computed tomography scanning had a 98% negative predictive value in this setting.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
